ction></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生是研究生多元招生体系的重要组成部分，是加强拔尖创新人才选拔、提高研究生招生质量的重要举措。根据我校研究生院下发的《关于2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名工作的通知》，结合我院实际情况，特制定本复试细则（本细则所涉及的规定如有更新，以教育部下达最新文件为准）。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/5PSKKANk7dN00ya6L6EwoygWibMARAfP7coE0TkianKOaO2XEYGFKF2rR9dSjLkkjmibXVwBOj6p9s8UuhdE5wnjjzpicmO8gVl9znxVLFTDgPQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人为有望获得所在高校推荐免试资格</span><span><span>的2027届应届本科毕业生；品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5PSKKANk7dNia1XcBPRbibOCibkQJsT8RoDchYwHWcHk8DlHwWPoay6v5a5d1roV4qiap82NOySDoA8p9hJ2xjRrupfapWEmL1lCCMYBDotXC0s/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span>申请与选拔考核程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.参加南昌大学人文学院接收推荐免试研究生预报名的考生可登录南昌大学研究生报考服务系统（http://gsas.ncu.edu.cn/），在招生项目中选择“全国优秀大学生夏令营（推免生预报名）”，根据提示先注册然后进入系统报名。</span></p><p><span>2.报名截止时间：</span><strong><span>9月14日下午17:00</span></strong></p><p><span>3.复试时间：预计</span><strong><span>9月18-20日</span></strong><span>（具体时间地点在南昌大学人文学院2027年预推免QQ群835656760通知）</span></p><p><span>复试地点：南昌大学前湖北院人文楼</span></p><p><span>复试方式：线下复试</span></p><p><span>4.复试内容包括：</span></p><p><span>（1）专业课笔试，满分100分，专业笔试内容以《南昌大学2026年招收攻读硕士学位研究生专业目录》初试参考书目为依据，https://yjsy.ncu.edu.cn/info/1012/23946.htm，采取笔试方式进行，笔试时间为1小时。</span></p><p><span>（2）专业综合面试（包括专业课面试、专业综合素质面试），满分100分。每位考生准备3分钟汇报，汇报内容可涵盖基本情况（包括本人的学习工作经历、学术成果汇总）、未来研究计划（可结合硕士拟开展的研究内容或自选以前从事过的研究项目）。</span></p><p><span>（3）外语听力与口语测试，满分50分。含1分钟英语自我介绍，口语问答。</span></p><p><span>5.排名规则</span></p><p><span>（1）根据考生综合成绩由高到低依次排序，中国语言文学专业按照文学类（含国学）和语言类两类方向排名，国际中文教育、中国史、档案学和哲学按照专业排名，综合成绩计算方法：综合成绩=（专业课笔试+专业综合面试+外语听力及口语测试）/250*100。专业课笔试、专业综合面试及复试总成绩及格线为 60 分，未达及格线者视为不合格。外语听力与口语测试不设及格线，但不参加者视为放弃复试；加试成绩及格线为 60 分，未达及格线者视为不合格，加试成绩不计入复试总成绩。</span></p><p><span>（2）我院将本次预推免生复试结果上报学校研究生招生办公室进行审核。“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（系统开通时间请参见中国研究生招生信息网相关公告，网址：http://yz.chsi.com.cn，以下简称“教育部推免系统”）开通报名后，通过我院选拔并取得所在学校推免资格的学生，必须在教育部推免系统中进行报名，完成后续相关录取程序，否则申请视为无效。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/5PSKKANk7dP1yic2e4jVkPgywQZovujAMoLfyLIv2ibict0rjv4cmjsxviaWtV5E1icVTJib06Cia8fo2kwdcfdXUJaGLGvxmSFScl1WE9x4aGoicw4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>三、特别说明</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（1）推免生提供的申请材料应真实准确，如有弄虚作假行为，一经发现即取消其研究生录取资格。</span></p><p><span>（2）学院确定接收的推免生，在入学报到时未获得毕业证书、学位证书者，取消其录取资格。</span></p><p><span>（3）已被接收的推免生不得再参加全国硕士研究生入学考试。否则，取消其推免录取资格。</span></p><p><span>（4）有意向直博者可先与本院或导师联系，待正式推免工作开始后，根据实际招生情况进行报名。</span></p><p><span>（5）本细则以教育部最新文件规定为准，如有变更，人文学院网将根据根据教育部最新政策，及时公布2027年接收推免生的最新信息，敬请关注人文学院网站相关公告。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5PSKKANk7dNyLaGnPibcANTLczFjBKoYgicABD0SKhibAlpc4uqejxjFCdwZPicH8yg0ujJSRviaPibpvT0Nj0NiaK8n8icq2eAoLKu28riccfMI12vE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>四、</span></span></strong><strong><span>咨询、监督与申诉渠道</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>南昌大学人文学院研究生办公室电话：0791-83968827</span></p><p><span>邮箱：rwxy@ncu.edu.cn </span></p><p><span>南昌大学人文学院纪检监督电话：0791-83969350</span></p><p><span>本细则由南昌大学人文学院研究生办公室负责解释。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>END</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>排版 | 顾安然</span></p><p><span>审核 |</span><span> </span><span>张雷婷、刘杰、范跃先</span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"54fdbe3fe0c189cad97d653503d14751c265a7a081e2e31b148376b588eba573","textLength":1534,"sourceSha256":"e3ad4fd4466a2085daaf